      "signature": "8801 2b21 011e cbee d805 0300 0007 cbca 8801 3221 011e cbee d805 0307 0007 cbca",
      "summary": "行星自己記錄word13非零時，指定商品供給0、需求7；在word6覆寫之後。",
      "rawOffset": "0x444ff"
    },
    {
      "id": "trade.class-shift-init",
